  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.1: HTTP/2 bug fixes — Fixed SETTINGS frame sending ENABLE_PUSH=1 (RFC 7540 §6.5.2 violation causing clients to reject connection). Fixed partial network read handling in client preface and frame reads. Fixed PipeReader/PipeWriter interference with HTTP/2 direct stream I/O. Combined HEADERS+DATA response frames into single TLS write for reliability. Fixed HTTP/1.1 request routing: unknown methods on known paths now correctly return 405 instead of 501. Removed incorrect rejection of Expect: 100-continue with body.",
